Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:29.88,Hook,,0,0,0,,¿VALIÓ LA PENA?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:03.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Diablos, no debimos\Nasaltar a esos dos del\Nreparto de dinero, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es culpa nuestra, nos lo\Nmerecemos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:08.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Ups. Ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:10.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Sacamos $500.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:12.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Chicos, salí en el\Nperiódico!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Valió la pena?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Se acuerdan cuando me\Ndisfrazaba de Ron Ottoman\Ny robaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:28.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}En la página dos del\Nperiódico hay una noticia:\N«Fraude Ottoman».
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Qué buena.
